# CODEOWNERS template for velnor-schemas
# Implements Q-2 schema ownership rules (Invariant §5, plan §2.5).
#
# Copy this file to velnor-schemas/CODEOWNERS and remove this header comment.
#
# Q-2 rules:
#   openapi/external/*   → @VelnorLabs/pm          (customer-facing contract)
#   openapi/internal/*   → @VelnorLabs/engineering  (service-to-service contract)
#   openapi/cross-tier/* → @VelnorLabs/pm + @VelnorLabs/engineering (both)
#   Everything else      → @VelnorLabs/engineering

# Default
*                                               @VelnorLabs/engineering

# External (customer-facing) OpenAPI schemas — PM must review
openapi/external/                               @VelnorLabs/pm

# Internal service-to-service schemas — engineering only
openapi/internal/                               @VelnorLabs/engineering

# Cross-tier schemas — both PM and engineering must approve
openapi/cross-tier/                             @VelnorLabs/pm @VelnorLabs/engineering

# Generated API clients — engineering only (auto-generated, never hand-edited)
src/api/generated/                              @VelnorLabs/engineering
